{
  "notes": [
    "Length-prefixed SHA-256 for the encrypted-discovery consume checks.",
    "statusAuthPub is omitted from the revision manifest and from epochRevisionId when absent.",
    "account-key-next.prev is the genesis entry hash. The head names the next entry.",
    "The SEA key does not sign the head.",
    "headSignature is the provider signing key over account-key-head. The account SEA pub is not that key.",
    "account-key-head appends decimal issuedAt and decimal maxAgeMs. A verifier with no anchor still refuses a head outside the max-age.",
    "checks store the accepted anchor entry. The hash is recomputed from that entry.",
    "headMaxAgeMs is the verifier ceiling. A signed maxAgeMs or policyMaxAgeMs above it does not extend the head."
  ],
